            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "Salt marshes are the most endangered coastal wetlands in Europe, along with their associated flora and fauna. The Mediterranean coast may lose up to 90% of those habitats by the end of the 21st century due to sea level rise.",
