            "paragraph": "However, in P. oceanica, mass flowering has been shown to be induced by warming (Ruiz et al. 2018; Tomas et al. 2024) and rare pseudovivipary has been observed in the Western Mediterranean after an unprecedented warming event (Tomas et al. 2024).",
